sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as scheduler
  participant X as MarketStack / Finnhub
  participant M as MongoDB
  participant D as DVC pipeline
  participant F as MLflow registry
  participant B as backend
  participant L as lstm-serve
  Note over S: 06:30 IST, Tue–Sat (or catch-up after sleep)
  S->>X: incremental fetch (quota ledger, retries)
  X-->>S: new bars + articles
  S->>M: upsert (unique keys, idempotent)
  S->>D: dvc repro process (unit tests → export → validate → Spark ETL)
  Note over D: a failed test or blocking data-quality check stops the run here
  S->>D: dvc repro score_sentiment, optimize_portfolio
  D->>M: weekly sentiment, portfolio
  S->>B: GET /api/prediction/{t} for the 10 stocks
  B->>L: POST /invocations (last 100 prices)
  L-->>B: 14-day forecast
  B->>M: store forecast (served from cache all day)
  S->>S: monitor: drift (PSI), live error vs naive, freshness → gauges
  S->>D: dvc push · git commit dvc.lock + reports (local)
